<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="<%= lang %>" data-theme="<%= theme.followingSystem ? 'system' : theme.id %>">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Forgeright</title>
    <%- include('partials/theme-head') %>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
    <header>
        <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">forgeright</p>
            <h1>This is Forgeright.</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="switchers">
            <%- include('partials/theme-picker') %>
        </div>
    </header>

    <p class="intro">It turns a short questionnaire about tedious work into a ranked view of what is worth automating. There are three ways in.</p>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>Sign in or create an organisation</h2>
        <p>Enter your email address. New here? This creates your organisation and makes you its admin.</p>
        <a class="button primary" href="<%= basePath %><%= adminPath %>">Continue</a>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>I have a link and want to participate</h2>
        <p>Paste the code from your invitation email, or open the link in it.</p>
        <form method="get" action="<%= basePath %>/q">
            <div class="row">
                <input class="mono-input" type="text" name="token" placeholder="Paste your code" aria-label="Your code" required>
                <button type="submit">Go to the questionnaire</button>
            </div>
        </form>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>Lost your link?</h2>
        <p>We can send a new one. Your answers are kept either way.</p>
        <a class="button" href="<%= basePath %>/lost-link">Request a new link</a>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
